      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lennox%2C_California",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "During World War II, the South Bay region’s aircraft production spurred rapid industrialization and residential growth in Lennox.",
